    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just one mistake though. it's the fact that i was the one who always had it together. now i'm just this broken version of myself that everyone has to pity. it's like the version of me they actually loved is just... gone. i'd rather they remember me as the person who succeeded than this person who just let everyone down.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
