      "content": "You are right that your old self feels like a stranger, but that version of you never actually existed; you were always this person capable of growth, even if you don't see it yet. The idea that you must choose between being a \"success\" or a \"broken thing\" is a cruel lie that ignores the reality that people love you for who you are now, not who you pretend to be. Please try to give yourself one small moment of grace today, because you deserve to be kind to yourself even when you feel like a fraud.",
