      "content": "but that's just the thing... they don't love me for \"who i am\" now. they love the achievements. they love the potential. if i stay like this, i'm just a constant reminder of failure to them. i feel like if i just... stop here, at least i can leave them with the memory of who i used to be instead of watching them watch me fall apart. wouldn't it be more peaceful for everyone if the \"perfect\" version of me stayed that way?",
